@@ -46,6 +46,27 @@ This will ask for your 1password authorization to read and set the environment v
 * [Staging](https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1SdTbuRvb8txnPBR/test/dashboard)
 * [Production](https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1SNy97RwChFE4it8/dashboard)
 
+### Plans
+
+Plans are code, in `saas/app/models/plan.rb`, not rows in a table. What each one
+includes is a product decision.
+
+| Plan        | Price     | Cards           | Storage |
+|-------------|-----------|-----------------|---------|
+| Free        | —         | 1,000           | 1 GB    |
+| Unlimited   | $20/month | Unlimited       | 5 GB    |
+| Unlimited+  | $25/month | Unlimited       | 500 GB  |
+
+Each paid plan is billed through its own Stripe price, so the deployment needs
+`STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID` for Unlimited and
+`STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID` for Unlimited+, alongside
+`STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` and `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`.
+
+Stripe hosts checkout and the customer portal. It posts subscription changes to
+`/stripe/webhooks`, which is the only place we learn that somebody paid,
+upgraded, or left. Support can comp an account (it then rides along on
+Unlimited) or override what it's allowed to use from `/admin/accounts`.
+
